            "text_4LedfA": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "Text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>It all began beneath a solar eclipse.</p><p>As the sun, moon, and earth aligned, something within me did, too. I didn't know it then, but I was standing at the threshold of a new life. A quiet invitation was asking me to stop searching outside myself and begin listening inward.</p><p><strong>There are moments that divide a life into before and after.</strong></p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "none",
                "alignment": "left",
